# SAMSARA's guard (the kit's rule 6; amb.h en_load): the audio load read by the app sheds voices in three steps before
# the sound can break up, and gives them back after calm. The simulator's load is 0 unless set here ("load N").
# The Setup page shows the load, its peak since switching on, and THIN while the guard sheds.
wait 500
tap GLO
wait 300
expect shed 0
expect cpu_peak 0
load 41
wait 300
expect shed 0
expect cpu_peak 41
shot calm.png
# between the two lines (50 and 62): nothing moves
load 55
wait 2000
expect shed 0
# at the upper line: a step every 0.4 s, three in all
load 62
wait 2000
expect shed 3
expect cpu_peak 62
shot thin.png
# half a minute on, the pad sings one voice at most
wait 30000
expect pad_voices <2
# calm: a step back every 20 s
load 30
wait 15000
expect shed 3
wait 50000
expect shed 0
wait 300
shot calm_again.png
